          "text": "My family and friends are together today. My brother plays soccer. I sit next to my classmate. My father reads a book. My aunt is a singer. My sister wears a skirt. Mr. Lee walks to school with his son. The student opens a book. My teacher reads a story. After reading, we choose two new words and make our own sentences.",
