        {
          "id": "l2-u02-p2",
          "title": "Animals and Nature: Second Reading",
          "type": "guided-reading",
          "theme": "animals_nature",
          "text": "We look around and notice animals and nature. That woman is our teacher. The air is cool and clean. The ant is near the tree. I see a bee. A week has seven days. A year has twelve months. My toe feels fine. After reading, we choose two new words and make our own sentences.",
